Source: sonic-config-validation
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: SONiC Team <sonic-dev@lists.sonic.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 12)
Standards-Version: 4.5.1
Homepage: https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-buildimage

Package: sonic-config-validation
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         sonic-mgmt-common
Description: CVL YIN schema generation scripts for SONiC management framework
 Ships cvl-gen-yin.sh and start.sh to /usr/bin/. At container startup,
 cvl-gen-yin.sh reads platform-specific YANG deviations from
 /usr/share/sonic/platform/cvl-yang, compiles them to YIN via pyang, and
 places results under /usr/sbin/schema/platform/<platform_asic>/ so CVL can
 load them before mgmt-framework starts.
